                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, my colleagues and I called on the State Department to get answers from Mexico about the recent increase in trash and sediment in the Tijuana River. While we\u2019re making progress on fixing wastewater treatment on our side of the border, we need Mexico to work with us to stop the flows at the heart of the problem. The people of San Diego deserve nothing less. https://t.co/Xpu96QeW0m",
