                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The broken South Bay wastewater treatment plant is the federal government\u2019s responsibility. That's why it's important for federal officials to understand the scope of the problem. I appreciate U.S. Deputy Secretary of State Richard R. Verma traveling to San Diego to see (and smell) the cross-border sewage problem firsthand. https://t.co/Za4wwPJJ8O",
