                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "San Diegans deserve beaches free from sewage and air free from toxic gasses.\n\n@SenAlexPadilla and I are calling for emergency funds to help us fix the broken wastewater treatment plant, which will be instrumental in ending this crisis. \n\nThank you to @Senlaphonza, @RepJuanVargas, @RepSaraJacobs, @RepMikeLevin, and seven other members of Congress for joining us.",
