                "text": "Cross-border sewage is an environmental & public health disaster.\u2028\nYesterday, rehab & expansion of the South Bay International Wastewater Treatment Plant began, using the &gt;$400M secured by Congress.\n\u00a0\nI have included my full remarks from the event below.\n\nhttps://t.co/wAMXtgBAV7",
