                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Gov spending deal includes $250 MILLION to tackle cross-border sewage!\nThis is enough to fix & upgrade our broken wastewater treatment plant. I led the request for this $ with the backing of SD's congressional delegation and will keep fighting for clean water, air, & beaches. https://t.co/afI2AkAXyz",
