                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was a bumpy road, but today I voted to avoid a costly government shutdown and provide much needed disaster aid, including $250 million to completely fund the repairs and expansion of the dilapidated South Bay International Wastewater Treatment Plant. I\u2019m also glad we removed the irresponsible debt limit increase.",
